  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">IIT JEE Advanced Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-03T17:28:16+05:30\">June 3, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">5:28 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://jeeadv.ac.in/\">Indian Institute of Technology (IIT Roorkee)</a></strong> has release the <strong>Result</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for admission to<strong> IIT JEE Advanced 2026</strong>. The <strong>examination</strong> was conducted on<strong> 17 May 2026</strong>. The IIT JEE Advanced 2026 <strong>application process started on 23 April 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to <strong>submit their applications until 05 May 2026</strong>. Candidates can download their <strong>Result</strong>&nbsp;using their <strong>Application Number, Password, or Security Pin by logging into the portal</strong>. The <strong>direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">IIT JEE Advanced Result 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">IIT JEE Advance Admission 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/iit-jee-advanced-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Start Date : <b>23 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date :<b> 05 May 2026 (Extended)</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Online Payment :&nbsp;<b>05 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> 17 May 2026</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Question Paper :<span style=\"color: #000000;\"> <strong>21 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>25 May 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key Objection :<strong> 25-26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"f